DESCRIPTION:Saturday December 19th\, 2026 - 7:30PM\nClub 337 1521 W Pinhook
  Rd\, Lafayette\, LA\nLafayette Comedy presents comedian SEAN PATTON (as s
 een on Peacock\, FX's English Teacher\, Late Night with Jimmy Fallon) at C
 lub 337 on Saturday\, December 19 at 7:30 p.m.\nTickets are on sale for $3
 0 VIP\, $25 General Admission (plus taxes/fees)\nDoors at 7:00 p.m.\nAGES 
 18+\nSean Patton is a comedian based in New York\, by way of New Orleans.\
 nHe began doing stand-up in the Crescent City and has since performed in c
 omedy clubs and festivals across the world\, including The Melbourne Inter
 national Comedy Festival (2011\, 2018)\, The Glasgow Comedy Fest (2016)\, 
 the Dublin Comedy Fest (2017)\, and The Edinburgh Fringe (2017\, 2019). Ot
 her festival appearances include SXSW (2016\, 2017\, 2018\, 2022)\, The Mo
 ontower Comedy Festival (2012\, 2013\, 2014\, 2019)\, Just for Laughs Chic
 ago (2013)\, Just for Laughs Toronto (2013)\, and Just for Laughs Montreal
  (2008\, 2010\, 2012\, 2016\, 2018). He's performed on Comedy Central’s 
 Live at Gotham (2009)\, Late Night with Jimmy Fallon (2010)\, Conan (2011\
 , 2013)\, and Comedy Central’s The Half Hour (2013). More recently\, He'
 s been on @midnight (2014\, 2015)\, The Meltdown with Jonah and Kumail (20
 15)\, This Is Not Happening (2015\, 2017\, 2019)\, Showtime's Live from SX
 SW (2017)\, TruTV's Comedy Knockout (2016\, 2017\, 2018)\, and This Week a
 t the Comedy Cellar (2018\, 2019\, 2020).\nIn 2019\, he released his secon
 d album\, Scuttlebutt\, on Helium Records. His next album\, King Scorpio\,
  was released on Christmas Eve 2021 and as a special on YouTube in August 
 2022. His special Number One streamed on Peacock from 2022 to 2024 and is 
 currently available on 800lb Gorilla’s YouTube page.\nAs for acting\, He
 's appeared on IFC'S Maron\, TruTV's Those Who Can't\, and both seasons of
  FX’s English Teacher. He more recently appeared in season 5 of HBO’s 
 Hacks.\nUnless otherwise stated\, please consider all of our shows as “a
 dult subject matter.”\nNo refunds will be issued unless the show is canc
 eled or rescheduled.\nNo third-party tickets allowed (do not purchase from
  StubHub or other 3rd party sites)\nClub 337 is located inside the Doublet
 ree Hotel located at 1521 W Pinhook Rd\, Lafayette\, LA. (Free Parking)\nC
 lub 337 has theater-style seating as a first-come basis | Drinks can be pu
 rchased at the bar | 2 full bars with a restaurant on site.\n\nhttps://hap
